blocks.english:
Let all acknowledge Jesus;
Ask for His love;
Seek Jesus ardently;
And in seeking Him, grow fervent.

Love Him who loves thee thus;
Return love for love;
Run after this fragrance,
And answer vows with vows.

This love, sent from heaven,
Clings to my inmost being;
It kindles the mind completely;
In it the spirit finds delight.

His taste so moves me;
His fragrance so refreshes me.
In Him my mind fails;
He alone suffices for the lover.

Citizens of heaven, come forth;
Lift up your gates;
Say to the conqueror:
Hail, Jesus, renowned King!
